msgid "Adjust anti-aliasing: 0 off 1 fxaa 2 smaa 3 taa 4 fsr 5 dlss."
msgstr "Ajusta o antisserrilhamento: 0 desativado, 1 FXAA, 2 SMAA, 3 TAA, 4 FSR, 5 DLSS."

